{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLElementPosition","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLElementPosition","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLElementPosition","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLElementPositionV"},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/init(element:position:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/element","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/position"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLElementPosition"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The element and position attributes are new as of Version 2.0. They allow for bookmarks and links to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positioned at higher resolution than the level of music-data elements. When no element and position attributes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are present, the bookmark or link element refers to the next sibling element in the MusicXML file. The element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attribute specifies an element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bookmark. The position attribute specifies the position of this descendant element, where the first position"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is 1. The position attribute is ignored if the element attribute is not present. For instance, an element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value of “beam” and a position value of “2” defines the link or bookmark to refer to the second beam"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark. This is equivalent to an XPath test of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[.\/\/beam[2]] done in the context of the sibling element."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition"]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/s8CopyableP":{"title":"Swift.Copyable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP"},"doc://IvorMXL/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP"},"doc://IvorMXL/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolv